{"version":1,"content":"<p>位於印尼峇里島東南岸對開的佩尼達島（Nusa Penida），當地有海灘俱樂部推出小型觀光潛艇體驗，毋須濕身便可潛入海底賞珊瑚魚。</p><p>此外，島上亦可體驗動力滑翔傘、於崖頂用餐，以及入住海灣與叢林交融的特色別墅，令人想暢遊一番！</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.659962+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:00:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:13.376068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:13.376068+00:00","content_hash":"67e69bb6499b11857ff7e22813dda0dd56f109d8589a9e0d48c95e48c605798a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}